      "sourceText": "这里最关键的不是“前后指针必须分别使用哪一种智能指针”，而是要先判断所有权关系：**真正负责对象生命周期的一方使用 `shared_ptr`，只负责观察的一方使用 `weak_ptr`。**",
      "translatedText": "The most critical point here is not \"which type of smart pointer must be used for the forward and backward pointers respectively,\" but rather to first determine the ownership relationship:**The party truly responsible for the object's lifetime uses `shared_ptr`, while the party only responsible for observation uses `weak_ptr`\\.**",
