      "sourceText": "C 风格数组（`int arr[5]`）有很多缺点：不能直接赋值、传给函数时会退化成指针丢失大小信息、没有边界检查。而 `std::vector` 虽然功能强大，但它是动态分配内存的，有微小的额外开销。",
      "translatedText": "C\\-style arrays (`int arr[5]` ) have many drawbacks: they cannot be directly assigned, they decay to pointers when passed to functions, losing size information, and they lack bounds checking\\. While `std::vector` is powerful, it uses dynamically allocated memory and incurs a slight overhead\\.",
